= King [+ king +] reshuffles <span style="color:#008C45">Regi</span><span style="color:#CFCFCF">o Eser</span><span style="color:#CD212A">cito</span> leadership

The Minister of War, under suggestion of King [+ king +] has begun a reshuffling of the leadership of the <span style="color:#008C45">Regi</span><span style="color:#CFCFCF">o Eser</span><span style="color:#CD212A">cito</span>, which have seen some of the officers and soldiers more sympathetic to our cause removed from power and reassigned to missions in the colonies abroad, harming our influence.

- @root: There is nothing we can do.

